D%7D%7D%2C%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22weapon%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22forging%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fuploadstatic.mihoyo.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2021%2F09%2F07%2F91006211%2Fc55e2dea7bff89da2b6943cb739b3c06_1925821202937430818.png%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%8C%E7%99%BE%E6%89%8B%E5%B7%A8%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%9D%E5%9E%8B%E3%80%8D%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%90%8E%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E9%87%8D%E7%82%AE%E8%9B%8B%E6%B1%A0%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22num%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F77%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%2C%22otherMaterial%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22num%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22num%22%3A50%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22num%22%3A4%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1668333122967\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/91006211/3ced18b5a203e3d0651e9479d0668b67_2502373466348416448.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">393</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">39</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在经历了无数次淬火与锤炼之后，米高扬中央设计制造局终于为“百手巨人”这个名字划上了终结的句号。这把以神话巨人为名的武器，是否能成为蛇的看守，将“泰坦巨神”消灭殆尽呢······</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">巨人之怒</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:30秒]引导生成持续6秒的时空场，对范围内的敌人造成共8*450.0%攻击力的物理伤害，并使被影响的敌人在期间持续处于时空减速和脆弱状态（ 防御力降低65.0% ），脆弱状态在时空场结束后会继续持续4秒。技能持续期间角色处于无敌状态，且可以切换至其他角色而不打断引导。使用技能后，队伍中其他装备该武器的角色30秒内无法使用武器主动技能</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">百臂\t\t\t\t\t</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色使用特定攻击后，武器会切换攻击模式。每次切换后角色获得一层强化效果，持续40秒，最多叠加10次，重复获得刷新持续时间。每层强化效果使角色受到的全伤害降低3.00%，暴击率提高2.00%，移动速度提高2%</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">理之律者：每次使用炮击后切换，顺序为导弹-火炮-激光，每次切换回复自身2点能量</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">异度黑核侵蚀：使用三段蓄力攻击后切换，顺序为多重制导导弹-多重制导导弹-特殊激光，每次切换回复自身5.0点能量</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">迷城骇兔：每次使用蓄力攻击后切换，顺序为导弹-火炮-激光，每次切换回复自身5.0点能量，每个无人机的特殊攻击方式为召唤时迷城骇兔当前切换到的攻击模式</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">其他角色：使用三段蓄力攻击后切换,顺序为多重制导导弹-速射炮-特殊激光，每次切换回复自身5.0点能量</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">多面一体\t\t\t\t\t</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色攻击速度提高25%；该武器在计算加成时，同时视作火炮、导弹和速射武器。不同属性角色装备时，获得不同的额外效果</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">机械：全伤害提高16.0%</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">生物：物理伤害提高20.0%</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">异能：攻击速度提高20.0%</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">量子和虚数：全元素伤害提高25.0%</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/77/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/07/91006211/c55e2dea7bff89da2b6943cb739b3c06_1925821202937430818.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「百手巨人初型」图鉴后任意重炮蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2250%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%88%B1%E5%9B%A0%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%8E%AF%E7%A3%81%E6%9C%BA%22%2C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22c