ch-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">可选的输出武器，因为歼星的超限性价比较低</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/17/91006211/d347ab83f351fac4b323d0fa1528c6c2_1951300193195228120.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>彗星驱动</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用时一般携带辅助圣痕作为物理辅助使用。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/b17a0b61a10fd22a1aa23b68b2f5b0ec_7714969707092678801.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">集输出与辅助与一体的全能型武器，在辅助方面，由于主动技能生成的时空场会使范围内敌人持续处于时空减速与脆弱（防御力降低65％）状态，不仅补足了脆弱，搭配山吹的盾波还实现了延迟触发buff加成。彗星驱动辅助时可以搭配毕加索使用；在输出方面，也是异度黑核侵蚀的全新毕业武器，在理之律者没有真理之钥的情况下，也可作为下位替代。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/b17a0b61a10fd22a1aa23b68b2f5b0ec_7714969707092678801.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
